664
00:40:50,667 --> 00:40:52,708
Terima kasih, dr. Taylor.

665
00:40:52,792 --> 00:40:54,250
Sama-sama, Bu Rose.

666
00:40:54,333 --> 00:40:55,458
Panggil aku Alex.

667
00:40:55,542 --> 00:40:56,542
Aku Garrett.

668
00:40:58,250 --> 00:40:59,958
Perlu bahas berkas lainnya?

